WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.943
Today we will communicate ideas through body movement. Our work connects with

00:00:04.943 --> 00:00:07.709
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:11.776
Choose a character and identify one important action.

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:15.966
Try three gestures that communicate the action without words.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:21.863
Show your gesture sequence while a friend identifies the story. Justify a revision

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:24.207
using evidence from another world tradition.
